        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Our programmers recommend..."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/sweet-milk-lake-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Sweet Milk Lake"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In writer-director-actor Harvey Zielinski’s coming-of-age drama, a young trans man’s homecoming results in unexpected consequences when he’s mistaken for his cisgender twin brother."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/elephants-in-the-fog-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Elephants in the Fog"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A parent’s search for their missing child disrupts the fragile coexistence between Nepal’s kinnar community and the rest of a village’s population."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/i-plant-my-hand-in-the-garden-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "I Plant My Hand in the Garden"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Playing versions of themselves as the central protagonists, Hoda Taheri and Boris Hadžija make a daring debut: a witty, irreverent and politically astute portrait of lives shaped by the search for belonging."
    }
  ]
